<p>You can create all of your branches from the default branch, or set up a dedicated branch that you use as a base. The first approach is simpler, while the second provides greater data isolation.</p>
<p><span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="database workflow A B" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fdocs%2Fget-started%2Fdatabase_workflow_AB.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fdocs%2Fget-started%2Fdatabase_workflow_AB.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fdocs%2Fget-started%2Fdatabase_workflow_AB.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p>
<h2 id="create-branch-methods" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create branch methods</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-branch-methods" aria-label="Link to Create branch methods"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>You can use either the Neon CLI or GitHub actions to incorporate branching into your workflow.</p>
<h3 id="neon-cli" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Neon CLI</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#neon-cli" aria-label="Link to Neon CLI"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Using the <a class="" href="/docs/reference/neon-cli">Neon CLI</a>, you can create branches without leaving your editor or automate branch creation in your CI/CD pipeline.</p>
